msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands-dialogs.docbook:274
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This dialog allows you to shear your image. By shearing, the bounding "
"rectangle of your image is transformed into a parallellogram. One pixel row/"
"column is kept in place, the next one is shifted by a certain amount, the "
"next one by the same amount relative to the previous one, etcetera. The X "
"and Y shearing angles can be set using the two spin boxes."
msgstr ""

