#: commands-dialogs.docbook:386
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The <guilabel>Histogram</guilabel> dialog</para>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands-dialogs.docbook:391
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This dialog shows a histogram for the current layer. With the "
"<guilabel>Method</guilabel> settings, you can choose what kind of histogram "
"to show. You can change the channel(s) to show with the <guilabel>Channels</"
"guilabel> listbox, and the scale on which it should be drawn with the "
"<guilabel>Linear</guilabel> and <guilabel>Logarithmic</guilabel> radio "
"buttons. Under the preview, there are buttons available to zoom in to, and "
"move over, the histogram. These are activated for 16-bit colorspace layers."
msgstr ""

